     - Google Distance Matrix (for calculating distance matrix useful in geofencing or travel times)
     - OpenLayers (JavaScript library for adding interactive maps)
     - Mapbox (open-source mapping tools for interactive maps)
     - MapQuest (mapping platform with services like directions, search)
     - Bing Maps REST Services (general mapping services, route creation, geocoding)
     - Google Geocoding (convert addresses to coordinates and vice versa)
     - Google Geolocation (get location from cell towers/WiFi)
     - Bing Maps Geocode Dataflow (batch geocoding for large data)
     - Other mapping APIs like ArcWeb, Decarta, Geonb, Scribble Maps can also be useful but less core.

   - From **location** category:
