2. Content Management: Users post local news, photos, videos, and discussion comments. The system should support uploading and retrieving multimedia content (photos, videos). Also, it should support content tagging and rating to filter and select relevant content.

3. Social Integration and Sharing: Users should be able to easily share content across major social networks (Facebook, Twitter, Google+). This requires integration with social APIs for sharing and possibly fetching social data (user info, friend lists).

4. Mapping and Geolocation: The content is posted on a map and needs visualization and interaction with geographic data. The mashup service will need to geolocate posts, search/filter content by location, and display items on an interactive map.

