- 'bing-maps' provides robust mapping capabilities and supports UK maps with rich features and route/traffic data if needed, aligning well with the mashup's requirement for displaying sightings on a map.  
- 'ordnance-survey-maps' offers high quality, UK-specific mapping data, enhancing the visual and regional relevance of the map, providing a local mapping solution specific to the UK.

