- Lyft: Well-known ride-share API for requesting rides, seeing available ride types, price estimates.  
- Uber: Another major ride-share API to access ride types and fare estimates, extend the service offering options beyond traditional cabs.  

This combination covers the core need of instant dial to cab companies (telephony), and extends to modern ride-share options (ride-share category).
