- quickblox: Provides chat, video, voice SDKs for mobile apps.
- plivo: Telephony platform supporting call making, tracking, recording.
- telapi: Platform for telephony apps that supports calls, SMS, recordings.
- vonage-nexmo-sms: SMS Services, less relevant voice.
- kooKoo: Telecom app interface supporting calls, IVR, SMS, user input gathering.
- voxeo: Voice platform with IVR, speech recognition, call control.
- hoiiio-voice and hoiiio-sms: Telephony and SMS platform.
- plum-fuse: Visual voice app editor with APIs to build voice apps, IVR.
- tropo-scripting: Cloud-based voice, SMS, IVR, voice recognition.
